sequenceDiagram
    participant app as Application Home Control
    participant zigbee as Adaptateur Zigbee
    participant transport as Transport Zigbee
    participant coordinator as Coordinateur ou bridge
    app->>zigbee: Execute(deviceID, turn_on/off)
    zigbee->>transport: WriteSwitch(deviceID, on)
    transport->>coordinator: Commande protocolaire
    coordinator-->>transport: Etat observé ou erreur
    transport-->>zigbee: DeviceState confirmé
    zigbee-->>app: CommandResult avec état réel
